  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to World Health Organisation Africa Regional Office (WHO AFRO)  is a component of Tackling Deadly Diseases in Africa Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;20,495,046. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control, Health policy and administrative management, Health personnel development.</narrative>
